            "value": "此模型版本无法使用工具。请在“模型”中选择它的 MLX 版本。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Esta versão do modelo não pode usar ferramentas. Escolha uma versão MLX dele em Modelos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes every chat, including archived ones, and every project on this iPhone. Downloaded models stay. This can't be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes every chat, including archived ones, and every project on this iPhone. Downloaded models stay. This can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "यह इस iPhone की हर चैट (आर्काइव की गई सहित) और हर प्रोजेक्ट हटा देता है। डाउनलोड किए गए मॉडल बने रहते हैं। इसे पूर्ववत नहीं किया जा सकता।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Esto elimina todos los chats, incluidos los archivados, y todos los proyectos de este iPhone. Los modelos descargados se conservan. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cela supprime toutes les discussions, y compris archivées, et tous les projets de cet iPhone. Les modèles téléchargés sont conservés. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Dadurch werden alle Chats, auch archivierte, und alle Projekte auf diesem iPhone entfernt. Heruntergeladene Modelle bleiben erhalten. Dies kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "アーカイブ済みを含むすべてのチャットと、このiPhone上のすべてのプロジェクトが削除されます。ダウンロード済みのモデルは残ります。この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这将移除这部 iPhone 上的所有对话（包括已归档的）和所有项目。已下载的模型会保留。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Isso remove todas as conversas, inclusive as arquivadas, e todos os projetos deste iPhone. Os modelos baixados permanecem. Não é possível desfazer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes it from the project. Adding it back re-extracts and re-indexes it.": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes it from the project. Adding it back re-extracts and re-indexes it."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "यह इसे प्रोजेक्ट से हटा देता है। दोबारा जोड़ने पर यह फिर से एक्सट्रैक्ट और इंडेक्स होगा।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Esto lo quita del proyecto. Si lo vuelves a añadir, se extrae e indexa de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cela le retire du projet. Le rajouter le réextrait et le réindexe."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Dadurch wird es aus dem Projekt entfernt. Beim erneuten Hinzufügen wird es neu extrahiert und indexiert."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "プロジェクトから削除されます。再度追加すると、再抽出と再インデックスが行われます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这将把它从项目中移除。重新添加时会重新提取并重新建立索引。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Isso o remove do projeto. Adicioná-lo de volta extrai e indexa tudo de novo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This takes a few minutes. Stay on Wi-Fi if you can.": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This takes a few minutes. Stay on Wi-Fi if you can."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "इसमें कुछ मिनट लगते हैं। हो सके तो Wi-Fi पर बने रहें।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Esto tarda unos minutos. Mantente en Wi-Fi si puedes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cela prend quelques minutes. Restez sur Wi-Fi si possible."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Das dauert einige Minuten. Bleiben Sie nach Möglichkeit im Wi-Fi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "数分かかります。できればWi-Fiに接続したままにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这需要几分钟。如有可能，请保持连接 Wi-Fi。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Isso leva alguns minutos. Fique no Wi-Fi se puder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This works while both are on this Wi-Fi. To reach this Mac from anywhere, add its VPN or mesh hostname — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — under Mac › Custom address.": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This works while both are on this Wi-Fi. To reach this Mac from anywhere, add its VPN or mesh hostname — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — under Mac › Custom address."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "यह तब काम करता है जब दोनों इसी Wi-Fi पर हों। इस Mac तक कहीं से भी पहुँचने के लिए Mac › कस्टम पता में इसका VPN या मेश होस्टनेम — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — जोड़ें।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Esto funciona mientras ambos estén en esta red Wi-Fi. Para llegar a este Mac desde cualquier lugar, añade su nombre de host de VPN o malla — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — en Mac › Dirección personalizada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cela fonctionne tant que les deux appareils sont sur ce Wi-Fi. Pour joindre ce Mac de n’importe où, ajoutez son nom d’hôte VPN ou maillé — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — sous Mac › Adresse personnalisée."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Das funktioniert, solange beide im selben Wi-Fi sind. Um diesen Mac von überall zu erreichen, fügen Sie unter Mac › Eigene Adresse seinen VPN- oder Mesh-Hostnamen hinzu – Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "両方がこのWi-Fiに接続している間は動作します。どこからでもこのMacに接続するには、Mac › カスタムアドレスにVPNやメッシュのホスト名（Tailscale、Tailnet、WireGuardなど）を追加してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "两者连接同一 Wi-Fi 时可用。若要随时随地访问这台 Mac，请在 Mac › 自定义地址 下添加其 VPN 或网状网络主机名，如 Tailscale、Tailnet、WireGuard。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Isso funciona enquanto os dois estiverem neste Wi-Fi. Para acessar este Mac de qualquer lugar, adicione o nome de host de VPN ou mesh dele — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — em Mac › Endereço personalizado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tools is on, but every tool is off in Settings → Tools.": {
